# <type>(<scope>): <summary>
#
# ── Subject ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# type:    feat fix docs test refactor perf chore ci build revert
# scope:   crate without the postio- prefix (model, storage, search,
#          config, imap, smtp, sync, core, gtk) or: workspace, ci, docs
# summary: imperative mood, lower case, no trailing period, <= 50 chars
#          "add draft autosave"  not  "Added draft autosave."
#
# ── Body (optional, wrap at 72) ────────────────────────────────────────
# Explain WHY, not what — the diff already says what. Worth writing when
# the change encodes a decision, a trade-off, or a non-obvious constraint.
#
# ── Footer ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Refs: postio-abc            (always — every commit belongs to a bead)
# Closes: postio-abc          (when this commit completes the bead)
# BREAKING CHANGE: <what and what to do about it>
